Description: GTK4 network packet analyzer and PCAP viewer
 PacketLens is a GTK4/libadwaita application for viewing and analyzing
 network packet captures (PCAP/PCAPNG files). It provides packet
 inspection, protocol dissection, filtering, and statistics in a
 modern interface.
 .
 Features include hex view, protocol statistics, DNS/TLS/HTTP analysis,
 file extraction, conversations view, and timeline visualization.
